geom.c contains verbatim function extracts from
third_party/melee-decomp/src/melee/mp/mplib.c (doldecomp/melee).
The functions are mpRemap2d, mpLineIntersection, mpLineIntersectionH,
and mpLineIntersectionV, in that order. geom_oracle.rs checks each extract
against the submodule when present. These sources are test-only.

retail/geom.c changes only the fused expressions shown by retail main.dol;
each change cites the instruction address. The driver supplies bool, ABS,
and the shared gekko-math C FMA wrappers. All implicit contraction is off.
The verbatim build measures changes from the pre-audit arithmetic.

driver.c and the Rust test were written for this repository.
